 "appState": {
  "gridSize": 20,
  "gridStep": 5,
  "gridModeEnabled": false,
  "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"
 },
 "files": {},
 "strandsDrawing": {
  "alt": "A motion command enters gate_motion and is decided in order: the tool's allowlist variable allows silently; BYPASS_TOOL_CONSENT=true allows with a warning; no operator reachable refuses, naming the variable that would pre-approve; otherwise a Strands interrupt asks the operator and y dispatches, anything else declines. Every outcome is written to the audit log. The native drivers' move_to is the one command that does not pass through the gate today."
 }
}